# Cloud-Native API Gateway in C#

Below is a comprehensive implementation of a modular API Gateway in C# that addresses all your requirements. This solution uses ASP.NET Core, integrates with common cloud-native patterns, and includes the three core components you specified.

## Solution Architecture

```
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                API Gateway                          │
├───────────────┬───────────────┬───────────────────────┤
│  Reverse Proxy│  JWT Auth     │  Distributed Tracing │
│  Forwarder    │  & AuthZ      │  Middleware         │
